	gniso:history "The course of Waieli Stream (upper portion)(FID 1853132) and that of Waipahu Stream (lower portion)(FID 1854137) are collectively known as Waikele Stream (FID364681). Waieli Stream and Waipahu Stream are former BGN decisions and were vacated in 1954 when the Board approved the name Waikele Stream for the entire course of the feature."@en ;
