	gniso:dateFeatureCreated "2009-12-09"^^xsd:date ;
	gniso:description "This NHL offers public access. Please contact the NHL directly for visitor information."@en ;
	gniso:history "This site commemorates Admiral Chester W. Nimitz's role as the Commander in Chief of the Pacific Fleet during World War II. Nimitz (1885-1966) was commander from 1942 until mid-December 1945, commanding all American land, sea, and air areas. Admiral Nimitz played a major role in campaigns such as the Battle of Midway, the liberation of Guam, and the seizure of of Saipan and Tinian in the Marianas."@en ;
	gniso:officialName "Cincpac Headquarters"@en ;
	gniso:citation "Data received from an Internet site or email other than USGenWeb (Reference code US-T146). The website title or email originator follows (if known):"@en ;
	gniso:dateNameCreated "2009-12-09"^^xsd:date .

